  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>！警告！</strong></span></p><p>此模组仍在开发中，目前不会影响实际游戏。<br><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SUnDVJO.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/SUnDVJO.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"250\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gwd1Q0w.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gwd1Q0w.png\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></span></span></p><p>这个模组添加了许多首领怪物。</p><p>这些首领十分强大，击败它们后可以获得丰厚的奖励。</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">首领可以通过特定物品召唤。</span></p><p>战胜首领，不断成长！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>另外，作为开发者，我是韩国人（그리고 개발자인 저는 한국인입니다）</p><p>-Legendnoob07-<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">本模组需要 GeckoLib</a><br><br>西瓜巨像</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xsO4KqG.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/xsO4KqG.png\" width=\"497\" height=\"454\"><br>生成：任意丛林生物群系</div><p>&nbsp;<br>流浪猎手 &amp; 流浪猎人</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TkPSCiY.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/TkPSCiY.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\"><br>生成：任意寒冷生物群系</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>火焰圣甲虫</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wIri3F1.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/wIri3F1.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"325\"><br>生成：沙漠生物群系</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>原始鹦鹉螺</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyQsAzu.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/IyQsAzu.png\" width=\"712\" height=\"609\"><br>生成：任意海洋生物群系</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>紫晶巨像</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/R7naRg7.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/R7naRg7.png\" width=\"388\" height=\"419\"><br>生成：Y=0 或更低</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><br><br><br><br></p>",
